# Contest management routes live under /admin

## Canonical paths

- Contest **management** routes must live under:
  - `/admin/contests`
  - `/admin/contests/new`
  - `/admin/contests/:id/manage`
- Do **not** add or re-introduce `/instructor/contests/*` routes.
- Do **not** keep legacy redirects for removed routes unless explicitly requested (prefer hard removal so old links fall through the catch-all).

## Guards & role config

- Use `RequireRole roles={ROLE_GROUPS.admin}` for any `/admin/contests/*` routes.
- Keep role arrays out of routing files; use `ROLE_GROUPS` from `src/config/roles.ts`.

## Link/CTA updates when routing changes

- Any UI entrypoints (buttons/links/navigate) that open contest workspace must target `/admin/contests/*`.
  - Example: `navigate("/admin/contests/new")`, `to={\`/admin/contests/${id}/manage\`}`.
- UI gating should continue using `canManageContests(profile)` (admin + support_staff).

